## 📋 **COMMAND CHAIN WE USED (SUMMARY)**

```powershell
# 1. Create folder
mkdir devops

# 2. Move files
Move-Item -Path .\Dockerfile.* -Destination .\devops\

# 3. List files
Get-ChildItem .\devops\

